Description ( WEBSITE ):
In the heart of Everest workshop, where craftsmanship meets innovation, lies the birthplace of the Craftsman boots. Crafted with meticulous care and attention to detail, these boots area testament to the artistry and dedication that define Everest ethos. But it's not just the craftsmanship that sets Craftsman apart—it's the material itself. Made from the finest crazy horse leather, each pair tells a story of rugged durability and timeless elegance. From the rugged terrain of the outdoors to the polished f loors of the office, Craftsman boots are the epitome of versatility, offering unparalleled comfort and style in every step.

&nbsp;

Craftsman is a safety shoe with steel toe cap, anti-slip and fuel resistant PU sole with steel in the middle crazy horse leather upper with mesh lining. MATERIAL-Inset Plate: Steel Plate-Sole: Black Dual Density PU-Insole: Cotton-Toe Cap: Steel Toe Cap-Upper: Crazy Horse Leather-Insock: Mesh COLOUR Black/Brown SIZE 3-14 CERTIFICATE CE EN ISO 20345:2011, STP SRC

&nbsp;

PRODUCT HIGHLIGHTS This protective footwear meets the testing requirements of EN ISO 20345:2011 as marked on the footwear. Quality injection mould, Steel toe cap to be impact resistant and Steel plate to be puncture resistant. Sandwich mesh inside, Wear-resistant, breathable, soft and comfortable. Oil/ slip/ impact/ puncture resistant, anti static, shock absorption. Industrial construction working safety shoes with long life. PRODUCT USE-Cutting/Perforation-Electrical-Slip Resistant-Shock Resistant-Construction/Civil Engineering-Craftman-Light Industry-Heavy Industry CERTIFICATION &amp; STANDARDS EUROPEAN STANDARD Regulation (EU) 2016/425 PPE EN ISO 20345: 2011 S1P SRC
